  "_about": "THE RACCOON (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/carn/raccoon.py): built from the red panda (its rig, sculpt and fleece) at 1.1 and reshaped -- the hind legs longer and the loin arched (the hunch), a muzzle 30% longer and pointed, fuller cheeks, smaller rounded white-rimmed ears; the black mask across the eyes, a white brow and muzzle, a dark stripe down the bridge (paints); hand-like paws with five long fingers, fore and hind; a bushy ringed tail (one sweep: five black rings and a black tip); grizzled grey, darker on the back, dark legs. Written whole by its script.",
